  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orangered pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Radiative-Nuclear Dynamo</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/02/Captain_Atom_SR.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200905222233\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Captain Atom SR\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/02/Captain_Atom_SR.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20200905222233\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/02/Captain_Atom_SR.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20200905222233 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/02/Captain_Atom_SR.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200905222233 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Captain Atom SR\" width=\"270\" height=\"388\" data-image-key=\"Captain_Atom_SR.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Captain Atom SR.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Nathaniel Adam/Captain Atom (DC Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb radiation and convert it to nuclear reactions</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>absorb radiation and convert it towards nuclear reactions</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Reactor\" title=\"Energetic Reactor\">Energetic Reactor</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Nuclear_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Fission Transmutation (possibly)</li>\n<li>Radiative-Nuclear Power</li>\n<li>Radiative-Nuclear Transduction</li>\n<li>Radiological Nuclear Transmutation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Nuclear_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb all forms of radiation and convert it towards nuclear reactions. This might serve as a method of nuclear recycling through the use of lost energy due to radioactivity. That being said, this could possibly be based off of the weak interaction that allows nuclear fission reactions to transmute one element into another. (That is if this ability is done through the decay of unstable nucleons). The user is essentially a radiological nuclear power plant.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Nuclear_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Conversion\" title=\"Radiation Conversion\">Radiation Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Fission_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Fission Manipulation\">Bio-Fission Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Fusion_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Fusion Manipulation\">Bio-Fusion Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatility_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Volatility Manipulation\">Bio-Volatility Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Fire Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Electromagnetic-Nuclear Dynamo\">Electromagnetic-Nuclear Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Manipulation\">Nuclear Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Fission_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Fission Manipulation\">Nuclear Fission Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Weak_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Weak Force Manipulation\">Weak Force Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Fusion_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Fusion Manipulation\">Nuclear Fusion Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Strong_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Strong Force Manipulation\">Strong Force Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Quantum Energy Manipulation\">Quantum Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear-Reactive_Dynamo\" title=\"Nuclear-Reactive Dynamo\">Nuclear-Reactive Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Power\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Power\">Personal Nuclear Power</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Fission\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Fission\">Personal Nuclear Fission</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Fusion\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Fusion\">Personal Nuclear Fusion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Ion_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Ion Conversion\">Radiative-Ion Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Plasma_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Plasma Conversion\">Radiative-Plasma Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Synergy_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Synergy Conversion\">Radiative-Synergy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Atomic_Transmutation\" title=\"Radiative-Atomic Transmutation\">Radiative-Atomic Transmutation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radioactive_Energizing\" title=\"Radioactive Energizing\">Radioactive Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Absorption\" title=\"Radiation Absorption\">Radiation Absorption</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Nuclear_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Mimicry\" title=\"Nuclear Mimicry\">Nuclear Mimicry</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Mimicry\" title=\"Radiation Mimicry\">Radiation Mimicry</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Nuclear_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capacitance_Manipulation\" title=\"Capacitance Manipulation\">Capacitance Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Manipulation\" title=\"Elemental Manipulation\">Elemental Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Sourcing\" title=\"Energy Sourcing\">Energy Sourcing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Radiation Manipulation\">Radiation Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Nuclear_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much energy user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in areas with a lack of energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Nuclear_Dynamo%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Prypiatosian-B\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ben10:Prypiatosian-B\">Prypiatosian-Bs</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Nathaniel_Adam_(Prime_Earth)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Nathaniel Adam (Prime Earth)\">Nathaniel Adam/Captain Atom</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Firestorm\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Firestorm\">Firestorm</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)\n<ul><li>Ronny Raymond</li>\n<li>Jason Rusch</li>\n<li>Martin Stein</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Major_Force\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Major Force\">Clifford Zmeck/Major Force</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://godzilla.fandom.com/wiki/Godzilla\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:godzilla:Godzilla\">Godzilla</a> (<i>Godzilla</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Galan_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Galan (Earth-616)\">Galan/Galactus</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Sergei_Krylov_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Sergei Krylov (Earth-616)\">Sergei Krylov/The Presence</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://batman.fandom.com/wiki/https:Firefly_(Matsudaverse)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:batman:https:Firefly (Matsudaverse)\">Garfield Lynns/Firefly/Phosphorus</a> (<i>The Batman</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260803220735\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 129/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 79/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.622      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%   10.622      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:507127-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20